1
00:00:00,452 --> 00:00:02,682
(Bernadette:)What will pay for itself?

2
00:00:07,759 --> 00:00:09,989
(Howard:)Doesn't matter.
What are you mad about?

3
00:00:10,829 --> 00:00:13,299
(Bernadette:)I'm mad at you
for blabbing to me

4
00:00:13,298 --> 00:00:15,028
(Bernadette:)what Leonard did
on the North Sea,

5
00:00:15,033 --> 00:00:16,503
(Bernadette:)and I'm mad that
I've had to hide this

6
00:00:16,501 --> 00:00:17,831
(Bernadette:)from Penny for two years.

7
00:00:17,836 --> 00:00:20,736
(Howard:)And you have every right to
be mad about those things.

8
00:00:20,739 --> 00:00:22,739
(Howard:)So, why don't you let me

9
00:00:22,741 --> 00:00:25,271
(Howard:)handle the credit card
bill this month, huh?

10
00:00:25,277 --> 00:00:27,177
(Howard:)I mean, don't
even look at it.

11
00:00:28,447 --> 00:00:30,647
(Bernadette:)I mean, if Penny finds out
I've known all this time

12
00:00:30,649 --> 00:00:31,849
(Bernadette:)and haven't told her,

13
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,820
(Bernadette:)she's gonna think
I'm a terrible friend.

14
00:00:33,819 --> 00:00:35,349
(Bernadette:)I wish you never told me.

15
00:00:35,353 --> 00:00:37,753
(Howard:)And I wish Leonard
never told me.

16
00:00:37,756 --> 00:00:40,056
(Howard:)He's the bad guy here.

17
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,290
(Bernadette:)I guess that's true.

18
00:00:43,295 --> 00:00:45,225
(Howard:)And you let
Penny marry him.

19
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,400
(scoffs)

20
00:00:47,399 --> 00:00:49,929
(Howard:)Compared to that,
who cares if I bought

21
00:00:49,935 --> 00:00:52,705
(Howard:)a George Clooney limited
edition manscaping kit?

22
00:00:57,309 --> 00:01:00,179
(Leonard(on phone):)Hi. I'm calling about your
marriage counseling services

